From: Androlinzberg <host@androlinzberg.local>
Subject: [PATCH] HWUI and NDK: connect stock SurfaceControl operations on the host

The hosted stock SurfaceFlinger/BufferQueue stack supports the existing native
control, transaction and frame-statistics paths. Enable those Android graphics
branches without enabling Android daemon or Vulkan pipeline dependencies.
Remove unused configstore includes from the original NDK surface-control API.

--- a/native/android/surface_control.cpp
+++ b/native/android/surface_control.cpp
@@ -15,12 +15,10 @@
  */
 
